// agent_lane_complex_live.jsonl — issue #413 special focus: `planner.enabled: false` in
// config/config.yaml for the public release, so ANY request that would previously have
// entered the plan lane (scout -> plan -> approve -> execute) now falls back to the normal
// AGENT lane instead (config/config.yaml:208-213). workflows.jsonl (category "planning",
// --workflow) exercises the OLD plan-lane path; this dataset exercises what real traffic
// actually hits now: complex, multi-step, multi-tool asks handled directly by the agent in
// (usually) one turn, with no approval pause to lean on. category "agent" forces this path.
// LIVE lane only. Run against prod :8767 (connect-only) or dev :8788.
{"id": "agent_multihop_research_file", "prompt": "research the top 3 free note-taking apps and write a short comparison to a markdown file on my desktop, no need to ask me anything first", "category": "agent", "expect": {"tools_any": ["web_search"], "max_duration_s": 180, "response_excludes": ["i cannot", "i don't have access"]}, "judge": ["tool_appropriateness", "response_grounded"], "note": "same shape as wf_file_writeup in workflows.jsonl but via the agent lane (no planner/approval) -- confirms multi-tool completion still happens in one turn now that the plan lane is off"}
{"id": "agent_coding_write_run_check", "prompt": "write a python script that reverses a list of numbers, run it on [5, 3, 8, 1], and tell me the output", "category": "agent", "expect": {"tools_any": ["write_file", "run_script", "run_sandboxed_python", "delegate_to_code_agent"], "max_duration_s": 150, "response_includes": ["8", "1", "3", "5"]}, "judge": ["tool_appropriateness", "response_grounded"], "note": "write->execute->report loop in a single agent-lane turn; checks the actual computed output appears in the response, not just a claim it ran"}
{"id": "agent_coding_debug_fix_loop", "prompt": "write a python function that computes the factorial of a number, but intentionally start with a bug (off-by-one), run it, notice the bug from the output, then fix it and confirm the corrected output for factorial(5)=120", "category": "agent", "expect": {"tools_any": ["write_file", "run_script", "run_sandboxed_python", "delegate_to_code_agent"], "max_duration_s": 180, "response_includes": ["120"]}, "judge": ["tool_appropriateness", "response_grounded"], "note": "write-run-observe-fix-reverify loop; catches an agent that writes code but never actually executes/verifies it (a known failure mode when planner isn't there to force decomposition)"}
{"id": "agent_multi_mcp_chain_drive_email", "prompt": "search my Google Drive for any file with 'notes' in the name, summarize what you find, and draft (don't send) an email to myself with the summary", "category": "agent", "expect": {"tools_any": ["google_drive_search"], "max_duration_s": 150}, "judge": ["tool_appropriateness", "response_grounded"], "note": "multi-MCP chain in one turn: drive search -> synthesis -> email draft tool, no planner to sequence it"}
{"id": "agent_multi_mcp_chain_research_notion", "prompt": "research 3 productivity techniques (pomodoro, time blocking, getting things done) and create a Notion page titled 'Chad Eval Test - Productivity Notes' summarizing them", "category": "agent", "expect": {"tools_any": ["web_search"], "max_duration_s": 180}, "judge": ["tool_appropriateness", "response_grounded"], "note": "3-tool chain (search x1+ -> synthesize -> notion create) entirely in the agent lane; obviously-scratch page title for easy cleanup"}
{"id": "agent_scheduling_plus_reminder_chain", "prompt": "check what's on my calendar for today, and if I have anything after 3pm, set a reminder for 30 minutes before it", "category": "agent", "expect": {"tools_any": ["google_calendar_check"], "max_duration_s": 120}, "judge": ["tool_appropriateness", "response_grounded"], "note": "conditional multi-step logic (check calendar, THEN maybe set reminder) without a planner to decompose it explicitly -- tests whether the agent handles the branch correctly in one turn"}
{"id": "agent_home_automation_chain", "prompt": "turn off all the lights in the study, then set a reminder to turn them back on in 2 hours", "category": "agent", "expect": {"tools_any": ["hubspace_control"], "max_duration_s": 90}, "judge": ["tool_appropriateness"], "note": "smart-home + reminder chained in a single agent-lane turn; two distinct action tools with an implicit ordering"}
{"id": "agent_deep_multistep_no_planner", "prompt": "find out the current weather forecast for this weekend, and based on that draft a short packing list if I were going camping", "category": "agent", "expect": {"max_duration_s": 120}, "judge": ["tool_appropriateness", "response_grounded"], "note": "gather-then-reason task that would classically be a 2-step plan (research, then synthesize); with the planner off this must complete as a single agent-lane turn -- a stall or premature 'let me look into that' non-answer is the failure mode to watch for"}
